  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the action is to support Georgia to mitigate the impact of the COVID-19 outbreak and to ensure the continuous implementation of EU related commitments, notably the AA/DCFTA (focus on environment, healthcare and VLAP).</narrative>
